     {
      "text": "Agrippa -- This (Acts 5:13) was Herod Agrippa II., son of the Herod Agrippa I. of Acts 12:1, and great-grandson of Herod the Great. (See Scofield \"Matthew 2:1\").\n\nBernice, or Berenice, was the sister of Herod Agrippa II. Acts 5:13."
     }
    ]
